        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** COMING SOON *** STUNNING 4 BEDROOM MID-TERRACE HOME *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb four-bedroom mid-terrace home to the rental market, coming soon to the ever-popular Millrace Court development in Saggart, Co. Dublin.\nThis bright and spacious property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers generously proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation briefly comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a modern fully fitted kitchen and dining area, four well-proportioned bedrooms, and bathroom facilities. The property further benefits from a private rear garden and off-street parking.\nMillrace Court is ideally located in the heart of Saggart Village, offering a fantastic range of local shops, cafés, restaurants, and leisure amenities all within easy reach. Excellent transport links include the nearby N7, M50, and Citywest Business Campus, while the LUAS Red Line at Saggart provides direct access to Dublin City Centre. A number of Dublin Bus routes also service the area, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n \nAdditional Features:\nComing Soon\nStunning 4-bedroom mid-terrace home\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nModern fully fitted kitchen\nFour well-proportioned bedrooms\nPrivate rear garden\nOff-street parking\nExcellent location in the heart of Saggart Village\nWalking distance to local shops, cafés, schools, and amenities\nLUAS Red Line nearby with easy access to Dublin City Centre\nExcellent transport links via the N7 and M50\nRegister your interest today\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
